WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.375
Foreign Interference.

00:00:02.325 --> 00:00:11.150
The National Security Committee of Parliamentarians confirmed that China and India systematically targeted Canadian democratic institutions.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.075
The PMO received CSIS warnings and failed to act.

00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:20.475
The Hogue Commission found foreign interference became systemic rather than episodic.

00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:27.525
The Foreign Influence Transparency Registry has been law for over 600 days with zero registrations.
